    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294140</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_300_020_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……にしても、派手に
やっちゃったんだね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...But you know, didn't they
overdo it, just a little...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294316</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_300_020_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>魔科学兵器は
デリス・カーラーン全体の
マナを吸い取ったけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That magitech weapon did consume
the mana of all Derris-Kharlan, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294316</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_300_020_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ここは直撃を受けた場所だから、
特にひどいんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...this is the place that took
the attack directly, so the
effects were especially bad here.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294408</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_300_020_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どうして、
きみがそんなこと
知ってるの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why do you
know that...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294552</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_300_020_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>え……なんでかな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh...? Oh, yeah...
I wonder why...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294552</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_300_020_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なんかぼんやりと
いろんなことが
頭に流れ込んでて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A lot of vague...stuff's
just kind of, flowing
into my mind...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294628</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_300_020_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>オレもなんかそんな感じ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, feels the
same for me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294692</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_300_020_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>………………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294856</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_300_020_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>故郷がこんなだもんね……
そりゃ必死にもなるか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I guess you would be
desperate, if this is what
had become of your homeland...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294856</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_300_020_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どうして、あの時……
気付けなかったんだろ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why didn't I notice,
back then...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295028</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_300_020_012&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>これって……もしかして……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait... Is this...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295088</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_300_020_013&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hm...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes>no idea what the context for this is</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295172</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_300_020_014&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>私の誕生日、
なんで知ってるの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How did you know
it was my birthday?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295244</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_300_020_015&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>誕生日なのか……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's your birthday...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295324</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_300_020_016&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>え？　プレゼントじゃないの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh? Then, this isn't
a birthday present?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295384</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_300_020_017&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>…………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295484</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_300_020_018&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……あはっ、
なんでもいいや。
ありがと、ダオス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Ahaha. Well, that's okay,
too. Thank you, Dhaos.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295588</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_300_020_019&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>いや……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's fine...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295588</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_300_020_020&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……絶対に、
なくすな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Never,
ever lose it...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295704</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_300_020_021&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>もちろん！　大事にするよ！
だって……ダオスがくれた
ものだもん！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Of course I won't! I'll treasure
it! I mean...it *is* a gift
from Dhaos, after all!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>295764</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_300_020_022&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>…………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296072</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_300_020_023&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あの日以来、あいつを
森の中で見ることはなくなった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>After that day, I
never saw him in
the forest again.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296072</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_300_020_024&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>思えばあれは
餞別だったのかもしれない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Now that I think about
it, he might have meant
it as a farewell gift.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296072</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_300_020_025&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ちゃんとあの時、気付いて、
止められたらよかったのに</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If only I had noticed what
he was planning, and
stopped him, back then...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>296072</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_300_020_026&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>せめて……
彼の想いを……気持ちを
ちゃんと確かめられれば……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But I at least want to...
understand what he was
thinking. What he was feeling...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
